WEBVTT

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:31.880
We do many things across the company.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:34.460
There is lot of stuff we are doing.

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:37.740
We might think, Google 
is merely a search engine,

00:13:37.740 --> 00:13:40.440
but behind the scenes,
with Sundar and his team,

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:44.660
Google is doing a lot of things
we might not know.

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:48.540
But these people are working constantly
in innovation and technology.

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:50.900
What is the future of technology
according to you?

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:53.030
You are the best person to ask.

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:56.010
We have been hearing 
talks on Artificial Intelligence.

00:13:56.010 --> 00:13:59.310
We've been hearing 
on Augmented Reality, Virtual Reality.

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:04.130
What do you think, we are going to leave
for our children and grand children?